{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀～～学园长～～～～！！”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "女子一同", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "go029", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘大家早安♪’", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "rk0044", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周一的惯例，全校集会。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们各务台来的学生对第二次的集会也习惯了。有些女生还混在结女的学生中发出尖叫。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这就是近朱者赤啊……”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0249", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“男生也尖叫一下比较好吗？”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“集会中禁止私下交谈。”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0250", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，从这次开始我的隔壁就站着濑名同学。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为担任班级干部，所以我站在各务台学生的排头，濑名同学则是站在结女学生队伍的排头。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘嗯～这次各务台的学生们好像也热闹起来了呢。’", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "rk0045", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听着各务台女生的尖叫声，台上的学园长非常愉悦地点了点头。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘男生们还在害羞吗？一起大喊也可以喔，喊“学园长～”♪’", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "rk0046", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，那就来喊喊看吧！喊‘学园长请责骂我～’这样！”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0136", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太同学，原来你这么M！？”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0194", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样喊的话结女的学生也都会骂你，对M男隼太来说很赚吧。”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要以我是M为前提讨论啦！不过好像很有趣就算了。”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0137", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我说了严禁私下交谈！”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0251", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过就算不尖叫，学园长相关的话题也够我们热烈讨论了。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "男生们……至少我和隼太是多多少少近朱者赤了。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──应该说以这个道理来看，只有濑名同学一个人保持着她孤高的颜色。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘老实说吧～我个人连体育课也想改成男女混合喔！’", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "rk0047", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但学园长兴致勃勃地鼓吹着学生们。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘这样一来我当然也会参加！会穿体操服喔！我可是还穿得起的呢～’", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "rk0048", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学园长穿体操服，想看～～！”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 439, "voice": "sa0021", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是自己穿的样子不想被男生看到～～～～”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "ja0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘喔，这个反应不错呢。你们这群少女现在正闪闪发光喔！啊哈哈哈！’", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "rk0049", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是想看欸，喂。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0138", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想看……”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "da0022", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“讨厌～男生好色～”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 440, "voice": "sb0023", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也想看……我也色吗？”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "jc0021", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长真的是个天才型炒热气氛的高手啊。跟以前学校的全校集会完全不同。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我不想看。”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0252", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──其中。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我想安稳无事地生活。”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0253", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我听到濑名同学小声地说。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我又来玩了～打扰啰！”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0107", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "pn0051", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐～！！”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0050", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，吃饭……啊，熊喵、天羽学姐。”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0255", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有种宾客云集的感觉呢！也就是说，现在是安洁出厂的时候了～”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0195", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是合并试办开始第二个星期的最后一天，午休时间已经变成这种感觉了。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哟，小樱乃。你拿便当来吗？跟我们一起吃吧！”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0139", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，不用说也会。”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0256", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟小熊喵也可以一起吗？”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0108", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐、熊喵，你们好。当然可以了！”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐在的话，我也要一起～”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0051", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟隼太、安洁和乾同学、天羽学姐和熊喵，以及樱乃聚在一起。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家说说笑笑地吃午饭……已经完全想像不出第一天那种尴尬的气氛了。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……那么像个女仆般聪明伶俐的安洁，此时就来华丽地为大家准备茶水……”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0196", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0109", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽学姐突然对我的脖子伸出手，让我心脏猛跳了一下。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“领带歪了喔……好，这样就可以了。”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0110", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，非常谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自然而然就注意到这种小地方，真不愧是天羽学姐。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0257", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊──！从以前就一直在想了，美羽学姐这是什么天然的女仆力啊！”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0199", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼欸？”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0111", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不能输……安洁、安洁遇到危机了！身为真正的女仆，此刻！”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0200", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……安洁对天羽学姐燃起对抗意识了？", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“糟糕！安洁又对美羽学姐！”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0052", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又！？”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家快逃！！”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0053", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在只能使出非常手段了……！”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0201", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊～！安洁一个不小心把托盘整个翻倒了──！！”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0202", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那是故意的吧……”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是不用担心，因为本人安洁！立刻就使出华丽的整理技巧！”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0203", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“超级自导自演欸！”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0140", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好的那位同学！请不要对细节进行吐槽！”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0204", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……欸、所以、也就是说。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来她是个自己制造出让自己发挥专长的状况，攻击性超强的女仆啊。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请安心，因为安洁会注意翻得不给大家添麻烦。”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0205", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，真的欸。杯盘都没有破，上面的东西也没有散落一地……”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是用莫大的细心达成的自导自演。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0258", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“常有的事呢，真的。不过很有趣所以算了。”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0054", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，很有趣呢～小菜夏。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0112", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“于是，面对自己的失误边流泪边收拾的安洁，呵呵，没有比这更经典的女仆了啊……”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0206", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要像女仆就什么都无所谓了啊。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为安洁的女仆表演（？），大家又谈笑得更热闹了──", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唔。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0254", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学回到教室，一看见我们就露出了不悦的表情。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "午休开始的时候她就离开了教室。", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，小爱理，你好～不介意的话要不要一起吃午餐呢？”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0113", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不用了，容我拒绝──”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0255", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜、呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "pn0052", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、等一下、不要过来啊！”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0256", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小熊喵也想跟小爱理一起喔～”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "mu0114", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我一个人就好了。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0257", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要那样说。我也想跟爱理一起吃。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0259", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔……你不是有哥哥在了吗？”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0258", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥是哥哥，朋友是朋友。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0260", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理也老实地臣服在美羽学姐的魅力之下就好了说。”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0055", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样的话熊喵给爱理负责照顾，我就能独占美羽学姐了！”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sn0056", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这人……”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0259", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明白了，爱理同学。总之安洁先帮你泡茶吧？”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "ag0207", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……安洁先把地板整理干净。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0260", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学回到教室后就被大家包围。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“仔细想想，这群人全部都有某种关联好惊人啊，濑名同学也是。”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0141", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他说的一点也没错。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……濑名同学！”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什、什么啦？”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0261", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是这样，所以你愿意的话要不要一起吃呢？”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0262", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "甩头。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是怎么样？不要让我说这么多次，我拒绝。”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0263", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也豁出去主动约她，但果然濑名同学还是不接受。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到濑名同学的态度，我听见结女的学生们发出窃窃私语。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──合并试办开始至今两个星期了。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本对教室的气氛有莫大影响力的濑名同学……", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯……”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar0264", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在看起来……感觉像是一个人被孤立在一旁。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥？”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "sk0261", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事，嗯。”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我深呼吸了一口气。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
